<title>USA: LIDAK CFO to resign. [CORRECTED 19:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>LIDAK CFO to resign. [CORRECTED 19:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIDAK Pharmaceuticals said Thursday its Chief Financial Officer Michael Lorber will resign to pursue other business opportunities, effective October 11.</p>
<p>(Corrects title in headline from CEO to CFO).</p>
<p>Lorber has worked at LIDAK since its inception in 1988.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it is actively seeking a replacement.</p>
<p>Shares of LIDAK, which makes products to combat virally caused diseases, were 1/16 lower at 1-7/8 in afternoon trading on Nasdaq.</p>
